2.15 Risk Assessment
Risk	Probability	Impact	Mitigation
Disease outbreaks	High	High	Vaccination and biosecurity
Feed price increase	High	High	Proper feed management and reduced wastage
Water shortage	Medium	High	Rainwater harvesting
Cold stress	Medium	Medium	Proper brooding and curtains
Heat stress	Medium	Medium	Good ventilation and cool water
Theft	Low	High	Secure housing and supervision
Predators	Low	High	Predator-proof poultry house
Market price fluctuations	Medium	Medium	Proper market timing and value addition
